  "description": "Net2HassMqtt adds Home Assistant (HASS) integration to your .NET applications via MQTT. It not a MQTT transport layer but provides an Home Assistant centric fluent configuration interface to map your application's models to Home Assistant devices and entities.\nThrough Home Assistant MQTT Discovery your application devices and entities just appear automatically in Home Assistant.",
